```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Kernel
    participant Splash as snowos-splash
    participant Systemd
    participant WM as FrostWM
    participant Sentinel

    Kernel->>Splash: Load GPU driver (Early KMS)
    Splash->>Splash: Render Vulkan Animation
    Systemd->>WM: ExecStart frostwm.service
    WM->>Sentinel: Request DRM Master
    Sentinel->>Splash: Signal SIGUSR1 (Yield DRM)
    Splash->>Sentinel: DRM Lease FD
    Sentinel->>WM: Pass DRM Lease FD
    WM->>WM: Initialize Renderer
    WM->>Systemd: sd_notify("READY=1")
    WM->>Splash: Signal SIGTERM (Exit)
    Splash-->>WM: Handoff Complete (No black screen)
```
